              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Karae",
            text: _("Darken Volk! I should have known it was you! What are you doing here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Taking back what is rightfully mine."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Karae",
            text: _("As impudent as ever. What lies in that book is not meant for human eyes — yours or mine."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("I am not here to argue."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Karae",
            text: _("Of course you are not. I assume your arrogance has only grown over the years."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("If you wish to continue lecturing me, by all means, do so. It will only make you easier to kill."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Karae",
            text: _("I regret that it has come to this."),
          },
        ],
